{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34104","headline":"杂体诗 奉詶鲁望夏日四声四首 平声 · 皮日休","name":"杂体诗 奉詶鲁望夏日四声四首 平声","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"塘平芙蓉低，庭闲梧桐高。\n清烟埋阳乌，蓝空含秋毫。\n冠倾慵移簪，杯乾将餔糟。\n翛然非随时，夫君真吾曹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34104.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34104","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}